; Both `(group …)` and its child `(item …)` declare `:lowering` — the self-
; contradictory container setup. The lowering pass surfaces it once at the
; child, `lowering_nested_lowerable` with path [item lowering]. Emit-only, so
; both hooks still fire: `group-normal` and `item-normal` emit and validate
; clean as :open terminals, leaving this single diagnostic as the only output.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code lowering_nested_lowerable :path [item lowering]))
